.TH CHTTPSVR_STOP 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
chttpsvr_stop \- close this server's listener
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpserver.h>

void chttpsvr_stop(chttpsvr srv);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Schedules the listener socket registered by chttpsvr_start for close
on the facil.io reactor.  Returns immediately.  The shared engine and
all other registered listeners continue running unaffected.

Idempotent: calling chttpsvr_stop on a server that was never started,
or that was already stopped, is a no-op.

Safe to call with NULL.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpsvr_start (3),
.BR chttpsvr_engine_stop (3),
.BR chttpsvr_engine_wait (3)
